{
  "name": "history-jan-to-apr-15-month-transition",
  "description": "A fixed-date calendar that changes from calendar years to 1 April years through a fifteen-month transition year, 2022-01-01 to 2023-03-31, split into five quarters of three calendar months. The dates are those of research/filers/linde-india.md; the quarter split, weeks and schemes are illustrative. Scheme 'fy' (the default, 'start') gives 2021, 2022, 2023 and the label '2022-23' for the transition. Scheme 'fe' numbers by 'end', giving 2021, 2023, 2024: 2022 is skipped at the change, which a non-default scheme may do, so 'FE2022' is LABEL_NOT_RECOGNISED.",
  "source": {
    "kind": "oracle",
    "citation": "Independent implementation of the spec in conformance/generators/fiscal_oracle.py, written with Python datetime and no fiscalclock code",
    "url": null,
    "checked_by": "fiscal_oracle.py: Calendar.seq built from the regimes and transitions; change_errors and naming_errors pass"
  },
